.TH SDL_HINT_HIDAPI_IGNORE_DEVICES 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_HIDAPI_IGNORE_DEVICES \- A variable containing a list of devices to ignore in
.BR SDL_hid_enumerate ().

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_HIDAPI_IGNORE_DEVICES \(dqSDL_HIDAPI_IGNORE_DEVICES\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The format of the string is a comma separated list of USB VID/PID pairs in hexadecimal form, e\[char46]g\[char46]
.PP
.BR 0xAAAA/0xBBBB,0xCCCC/0xDDDD
.PP
For example, to ignore the Shanwan DS3 controller and any Valve controller, you might use the string \(dq0x2563/0x0523,0x28de/0x0000\(dq
.PP
This hint can be set anytime\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

